        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we collaborate with our brand partners to develop merchandise specifically for our channels, known as “Made for Vipshop,” providing our customers differentiated products that are only available on Vipshop.",
