        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also adopted a “DevOps” software development methodology that automates and integrates software development and IT operations, which enables us to respond quickly towards business requests, significantly decreasing our development cost and improving our time-to-market.",
