        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also had 2,294 registered trademarks in China and 132 registered trademarks outside China, 291 copyrights (including copyrights to 253 software products in China that we develop relating to various aspects of our operations), and six registered domain names that are material to our business, including vip.com and vipshop.com.",
